      terminalRoic: "Terminal ROIC (stable period)", currentRoic: "current ROIC", moatYears: "Moat years implied by the price", moatN: "about {n} years", moatZero: "0 years (no excess returns needed)", moatBeyond: "over 100 years (excess returns alone cannot explain the price)", moatNoExcess: "n/a (ROIC at or below WACC)", moatNote: "Years beyond year 10 that ROIC must stay at today's {roic} above the {wacc} cost of capital for the DCF to reach the price, after which ROIC fades to WACC.",
